  "transformations": [
    "Minimum valid nonwater MAP friction over each 4×4 pixel block",
    "Centre-in-polygon Natural Earth labels with owner-reviewed routing table and disputed mask",
    "GHSL population >=100,000; all_touched urban footprints, larger population wins overlaps, majority routing-country clipping",
    "UC_centroids with nearest retained source-cell fallback",
    "Fixed population additive lead and deterministic (distance, -population, GHSL id) ties",
    "Exact bounded centre-switch threshold search; no ferries",
    "Single 15 km display tier; RGB8 owner PNGs with B = 0 and a separate shared RGB8 quantised 2020 density texture"
  ],
  "missingValuePolicy": "0 means no reachable city; 65535 means disputed. A city with no transport source, no larger reachable centre, or a resolution merge keeps a distinct status. Missing reviewed Chinese city names remain null and the Chinese UI falls back to English. Required English city names and Chinese names for every asset country are mandatory; missing Chinese city-name counts are recorded.",
  "boundaryPolicy": "Drawn countries use Mundus China viewpoint with Taiwan separate; routing uses Natural Earth default de facto polygons. Unknown land inherits the nearest known country without longitude wrapping. Nonlisted cross-border edges are closed; water and ferries are impassable.",
